sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Leaflet UI
    participant API as /api/analyze
    participant Weather as OpenWeather
    participant GIS as GIS orchestrator
    participant DEM as Open-Meteo
    participant Cover as ESA WorldCover
    participant OSM as Overpass
    participant Risk as Risk engine

    User->>UI: Click map location
    UI->>API: Send lat/lon JSON
    API->>Weather: Request local forecast
    Weather-->>API: Rainfall + current weather
    API->>GIS: Build local grid
    GIS->>DEM: Fetch elevations
    DEM-->>GIS: Elevation samples
    GIS->>Cover: Fetch land-cover tiles
    Cover-->>GIS: Class fractions
    GIS->>OSM: Query buildings/waterways/land use
    OSM-->>GIS: Local feature facts
    GIS-->>API: Enriched grid cells
    API->>Risk: Calculate transparent heuristic score
    Risk-->>API: Score, level, contributors
    API-->>UI: GeoJSON + sources + data quality
    UI-->>User: Colored grid and explanation
